    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "まず最初の鳥さんは……\r\n花鳥園の人気者、フラミンゴさんです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさん知っていますか？\r\nフラミンゴさんはとっても情熱的なダンサーでもあるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こうやって……\r\n群れのみんなで頭を振るのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "このダンスは今からみんなで恋をしよう、子育てしよう、\r\n助け合おう……って号令でもあるそうです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "また、フラミンゴさんが恋をする時期は、\r\n一年でいちばん鮮やかな羽色になります",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "尾羽の下から出る赤い色素を、くちばしで丁寧に羽に塗って\r\nきれいなピンクに見えるようにお化粧するんですよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100402/1001004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001004020120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふふ……っ\r\nフラミンゴさんのダンスやお化粧、見てみたいですよねっ",
